msgctxt "#31738"
msgid "Show resolution, audio and subtitle badges in media info. On by default."
msgstr "影片信息中显示分辨率、音轨、字幕等标识。默认开启。"

msgctxt "#31739"
msgid "Shows your own rating by default. Pick Rating for source ratings, or None to hide."
msgstr "默认“我的评分”。可选“评分”（来源分）或“无”（隐藏）。"

msgctxt "#31740"
msgid "Turn on when StrmAssistant's Douban override is active (the value shows Douban). Off shows IMDb."
msgstr "Emby 建库按这里选：默认 TMDb，开了神医助手豆瓣覆盖选豆瓣，装了 IMDb 元数据才选 IMDb。Kodi 刮削会自动识别，无需设置。"

msgctxt "#31741"
msgid "Follows the language setting by default. Or show the original title only, or both."
msgstr "默认跟随语言设置；可只显示原始标题，或原名与译名并列。"

msgctxt "#31742"
msgid "Covers full-screen pages and the cards inside them: settings, add-on browser, video and music info, home cards. Balanced by default."
msgstr "管全屏页面和页面里的卡片：设置页、插件浏览、影片和音乐信息页、首页卡片。默认“平衡”。"

msgctxt "#31743"
msgid "Covers popups while playing: OSD settings, playlist, bookmarks, process info, player controls. Light by default."
msgstr "管播放时的浮窗：OSD 设置、播放列表、书签、处理信息、播放控制条。默认“通透”。"

msgctxt "#31744"
msgid "Use item fanart as the page background, falling back to the default image. On by default."
msgstr "用作品背景图作页面背景，无图时回退默认图。默认开启。"

msgctxt "#31745"
msgid "Show posters for music videos in lists; off shows video thumbnails. Off by default."
msgstr "列表中音乐电视显示海报，关闭则显示视频画面。默认关闭。"

msgctxt "#31746"
msgid "Hides the Movies entry from the main menu when off. On by default."
msgstr "关闭后主菜单隐藏“电影”入口。默认开启。"

msgctxt "#31747"
msgid "What this row shows, e.g. recently added, continue watching, random."
msgstr "选择该行显示的内容，如最近添加、继续观看、随机推荐。"

msgctxt "#31748"
msgid "Browse opens the set by default; or play directly or queue it."
msgstr "默认“浏览”进入系列；也可直接播放或加入播放列表。"

msgctxt "#31749"
msgid "Hides the TV shows entry from the main menu when off. On by default."
msgstr "关闭后主菜单隐藏“电视剧”入口。默认开启。"

msgctxt "#31750"
msgid "What this row shows, e.g. recently added, continue watching, random."
msgstr "选择该行显示的内容，如最近添加、继续观看、随机推荐。"

msgctxt "#31751"
msgid "Browse opens the episode list by default; or play directly or queue it."
msgstr "默认“浏览”进入剧集列表；也可直接播放或加入播放列表。"

msgctxt "#31752"
msgid "Hides the Music entry from the main menu when off. On by default."
msgstr "关闭后主菜单隐藏“音乐”入口。默认开启。"

msgctxt "#31753"
msgid "What this row shows, e.g. recently added, continue watching, random."
msgstr "选择该行显示的内容，如最近添加、继续观看、随机推荐。"

msgctxt "#31754"
msgid "Browse opens the album by default; or play directly or queue it."
msgstr "默认“浏览”进入专辑；也可直接播放或加入播放列表。"

msgctxt "#31755"
msgid "Hides the TV entry from the main menu when off. On by default."
msgstr "关闭后主菜单隐藏“电视”入口。默认开启。"

msgctxt "#31756"
msgid "What this row shows, e.g. recently added, continue watching, random."
msgstr "选择该行显示的内容，如最近添加、继续观看、随机推荐。"

msgctxt "#31757"
msgid "Hide the OSD automatically while playing. Off by default."
msgstr "播放时无操作自动收起 OSD。默认关闭。"

msgctxt "#31758"
msgid "Seconds before the OSD hides. 4 by default."
msgstr "收起前的等待秒数。默认 4 秒。"

msgctxt "#31759"
msgid "Popup transparency"
msgstr "浮窗透明度"

msgctxt "#31760"
msgid "Popup transparency — steps are tuned for the dark theme; the light theme looks lighter"
msgstr "浮窗透明度 — 档位按透黑模式设计；透白主题下会更浅"

msgctxt "#31761"
msgid "Covers layers above pages: add-on info, add-on settings, dialogs, context menu, keyboard, settings sidebar. Dense by default."
msgstr "管叠在页面上的层：插件详情、插件设置、对话框、右键菜单、键盘、设置页左侧栏。默认“偏实”。"

msgctxt "#31762"
msgid "Technical flags as icons"
msgstr "技术标识用图标"

msgctxt "#31763"
msgid "Stop"
msgstr "停止"
